{
  "_comment": [
    "Machine inventory for the OneBoot release-verification pipeline.",
    "Copy to inventory.json (git-ignored) and fill in your lab. Secrets are",
    "never inlined: point at environment variables instead (github secrets).",
    "Each target maps one OS image to one physical/VM machine.",
    "boot_style: 'redhat' for CentOS/RHEL/Kylin/UOS/OpenEuler/NeoKylin/Rocky,",
    "            'casper' for Ubuntu live-server (autoinstall).",
    "artifact:   the release target whose tarball runs on this machine.",
    "bmc:        optional; omit and use --trigger manual to pick the menu by hand.",
    "ssh:        optional but strongly recommended - it is the most reliable way",
    "            to pull result.json back when the lab cannot reach the runner."
  ],
